      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KOOLIBAH (3) hit the line powerfully fresh up over 1550m, and then was a bold third over 2000m in metro company at Randwick nearly 2 weeks ago. JMac is back in the saddle, and she will be peaking third up, which, with the drop in class, makes her the one to beat. BEARINGS (5) improved sharply second up when put over 1800m, finishing on late to finish less than a length from the winner in second place. She drops 4.5kg with the rise in class, but she has plenty more to offer, and can figure in the top 3 again. COSMIC LAD (1) is dropping back in class third up from a spell, and an extra 400m will make a lot of difference for this capable gelding. A form reversal is expected. MY CARTOUCHE (7) missed the kick last start and did not recover. She is worth another chance.",
